  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 544.08 Discharge from Hospice Care. All medicaid recipients discharged from hospice care shall have a discharge planning process in accordance with 42 CFR 418.26.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-W 544) #13847, eff 1-6-24",
